#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/notifications.md:30
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| 档         | API                                           | 含义                             |\n"
#| "| ---------- | --------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| **即时**   | `deliverAlert` / `AlertBackend.show`          | 现在立刻弹                       |\n"
