msgid ""
"| 档         | API                                              | 含义                             |\n"
"| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------- |\n"
"| **即时**   | `deliverLocalReminder` → `deliverAlert` / bubble | 现在立刻提示                     |\n"
